namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamAdjustment {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIAdjustment.h#DreamAdjustment
    src   "One operation of an adjustment layer (UDreamAdjustmentLayer): its type, and the parameters that type reads. Colours and\nvalues are encoded (sRGB), as the blend modes are: the operations work on what the screen shows."
    text  "调整图层的一个操作：其类型以及该类型读取的参数。颜色和\n值采用 sRGB 编码，混合模式为：操作作用于屏幕上显示的内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamAdjustment:bEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIAdjustment.h#DreamAdjustment:bEnabled
