DreamAdjustment:Curve {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIAdjustment.h#DreamAdjustment:Curve
    src   "Each channel's curve: R, G and B of a colour curve asset (its A is not read -- a new colour curve's alpha is a constant\n1). A channel with no keys, or no asset, is left as it is."
    text  "各通道的曲线：颜色曲线资源的 R、G、B（不读取其 A——新颜色曲线的 alpha 为常量\n1）。没有关键点或没有资源的通道保持原样。"
    state machine
}

DreamAdjustment:Gradient {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIAdjustment.h#DreamAdjustment:Gradient
    src   "Looked up along the gradient's stops from its first (black) to its last (white); its type and angle are not used."
    text  "沿渐变从第一个色标（黑色）到最后一个色标（白色）进行查找；不使用其类型和角度。"
    state machine
}

